$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag Ground";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Surak V" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Hazy" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Afternoon" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	 "\n\n<f1>The call for maps has been answered..." @
"\n\n<f1> The teleporter in the bowels of the base leads to a hidden teleport chamber. Capturing the objective control in the teleport chamber will give the holding team a distinct advantage. <f3>ONLY THE HOLDING TEAM<f1> will gain the ability to teleport to the teleport platform below the enemy base, as well as back to their own base. There are two neutral teleports within the chamber that lead to the battlefield, just in case some would-be hero gets in over his head. These are not controlled by the control switch, and do not lead to the enemy base." @
"\n\n<f2>Map by Synsilliusarian! Enjoy!"; @


